# Fugitive Droid asks what the permanent was as it entered (CR 603.10a), not what it has become since. On turn 3 Bot1 plays
# Inkmoth Nexus (a land when it entered) and animates it with Mox Sapphire: an artifact creature now, but no artifact entered,
# so Bot2's Grizzly Bears may block the Droid, and kill it. (Darksteel Mutation, the card this stands in for, is not in the
# engine.) Reading the current types, the Droid would be unblockable and Bot2 would take 1.

